WEBVTT

NOTE
Source voice: Turkish. Translated subtitles; no dubbing.

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.000
[Music]
A table’s story does not begin at the table.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.720
At the sun’s first touch on the
earth, in a field still quiet,

3
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:11.865
it begins. Burcu brings
that story to your table.

4
00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:15.855
In produce picked at dawn
lies a season’s labour.

5
00:00:15.895 --> 00:00:20.691
Patient hands that know the soil
leave the first trace of flavour.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.400
Rooted in Burhaniye, this
journey reaches new tables

7
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:32.600
today. Drawing strength from its
past and looking ahead, Burcu

8
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:36.066
unites the work of the field
with production expertise.

9
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.720
As field-grown produce reaches the
facility, a new chapter begins.

10
00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:46.360
Here, experience, care and technical
knowledge share one purpose.

11
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.640
On the production lines, we
see the rhythm of machinery.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.880
Behind that rhythm is the
care that follows each line,

13
00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:03.400
hands checking every pack, and the
expertise of teams working together.

14
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.760
From receiving ingredients to processing
and filling; from packing to final checks…

15
00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:14.000
Laboratory testing and
checks throughout production

16
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.080
bring different specialists
together with one responsibility:

17
00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.440
trust in the product brought to the table.

18
00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:23.670
A spoonful of paste changes a dish’s colour.

19
00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:26.710
Roasted pepper brings a
different aroma to the table.

20
00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:30.470
A familiar ready meal offers
a warm pause in a busy day.

21
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.560
Beside every jar lies the
possibility of another recipe.

22
00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:41.480
From quick meals to lively
shared tables, Burcu’s products

23
00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:43.640
follow the kitchen’s changing rhythm.

24
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.400
Our business partners are an
important part of this journey.

25
00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:53.200
The connection from production
to delivery brings our products

26
00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:57.480
to more people. The relationships we
build together open tomorrow’s paths.

27
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.920
As we reach from Türkiye into
different regions, languages and habits

28
00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:06.880
change. Yet the feeling of gathering
around one table, sharing flavour

29
00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:09.360
and being together remains the same.

30
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.480
A shared meal leaves the day’s rush behind.

31
00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:19.720
People gathering at one table
give this long journey meaning.

32
00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:24.120
A story that begins in the soil
comes to life at the table.

33
00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:28.000
Burcu. From field to table, with care.
